    "html": "<p>A rotating disc undergoes uniform angular deceleration of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.1\\; \\textup{rad\\,s}^{-2}\"></span>, so its angular speed is reduced from <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"10\\; \\textup{rad\\,s}^{-1}\"></span> to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4.0\\; \\textup{rad\\,s}^{-1}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the best estimate for the total number of full revolutions that the disc completes during this process?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"6\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"10\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"20\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
